{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>&quot;You were chosen by the high council. You'll be sent to hell with our best equipment. Your mission: kill the devil. Fail us not!&quot;</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Profana merges the exploration and unlockable abilities of a metroidvania with the button mashing, combo making galore of hack\u2019n\u2019slashes. On top of that, you have a retro pixel art style, fast paced combat and lots of enemies to take care of. With a moody soundtrack and flashy visual effects, you will have a long journey ahead to kill the Devil!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Hellscapes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a lush forest to a futuristic cyberpunk city, you will have plenty of atmospheric locations to unleash your mightiest attacks onto the demon horde. Each region is protected by a guardian hellspawn, the most powerful and elite of the demons, ready to make mincemeat of you, should you challenge them unprepared. Also, to help you trailblaze your way through, you will be able to use your motorcycle, making those backtracking sessions way faster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/357c7502b55c30d2a4b1f3b1c38c1622.poster.avif?t=1771883554\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/357c7502b55c30d2a4b1f3b1c38c1622.webm?t=1771883554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/357c7502b55c30d2a4b1f3b1c38c1622.mp4?t=1771883554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/d625441b362cc6dca3863ebabf51a3bd.poster.avif?t=1771883554\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/d625441b362cc6dca3863ebabf51a3bd.webm?t=1771883554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/d625441b362cc6dca3863ebabf51a3bd.mp4?t=1771883554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At your disposal you will have different weapon classes, each one with its own attacks and combos, which you will have to manage and use them all if you aim to reach the SSSadistic rank. Not only that but everytime you finish a combo, you will launch a powerful magic attack finisher that gets stronger and stronger the more you raise your combo rank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/fbead7d649a863b6585151e835c7e002.gif?t=1771883554\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/fbead7d649a863b6585151e835c7e002.poster.avif?t=1771883554\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stylish Retro Graphics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blazing fast and fluid animations power this intense adventure, beautifully rendered in a retro-like pixel art style, you will experience crunchy visuals while battling your way through hell and contemplating the scenery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/bb0c5d46cc3878b1f73fcd04096efc3d.poster.avif?t=1771883554\" width=638 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/bb0c5d46cc3878b1f73fcd04096efc3d.webm?t=1771883554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/bb0c5d46cc3878b1f73fcd04096efc3d.mp4?t=1771883554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skill-based combo system where mastery rewards you with insane damage;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful and fluid retro-like pixel art animations;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse variety of weapons and items that allow you to craft your own playstyle;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big world with different routes to explore and lore to find.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT ARE YOU WAITING FOR?! TEAR UP THIS HELL ON A MOTORCYCLE AND DESTROY THE DEVIL IN\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/5bfced8d6b32a5d5e681dd2f7c23ce7b.avif?t=1771883554\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525610?t=1771883554","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/006e88d1192b1807c4980032e95167387f16e28b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771883554","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/741b644f51f99d28f6fbd7708842f44e50275362/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771883554","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/741b644f51f99d28f6fbd7708842f44e50275362/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771883554","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full con