em_assets/steam/apps/3525610/af87742fec255d74237a2558a3cc48b2469e8111/ss_af87742fec255d74237a2558a3cc48b2469e8111.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771883554","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/af87742fec255d74237a2558a3cc48b2469e8111/ss_af87742fec255d74237a2558a3cc48b2469e8111.600x338.jpg?t=1771883554"}],"short_description":"Hack\u2019n\u2019Slash your way to victory in this over-the-top action metroidvania. You are an angel tasked with one mission: infiltrate Hell, find the Devil and bring him to justice. Explore different hellscapes, find amazing new weapons and sanctify all demons with SSSadistic combos in Profana!","steam_appid":3525610,"support_info":{"email":"pyromaniky@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Portuguese - Brazil, French, Italian, German, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Russian, Thai","type":"game","website":null}